<title>USA: US to sell $30 bln of 2-, 5-yr notes Jan 22, 23.</title>
<headline>US to sell $30 bln of 2-, 5-yr notes Jan 22, 23.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Treasury Department said on Wednesday that it will sell $17.5 billion of 2-year notes on Jan 22 and $12.5 bln of 5-yr notes on Jan 23 to refund $27.916 billion of securities maturing Jan 31 and to raise $2.075 billion of new cash.</p>
<p>The notes will be issued Jan 31. The two-year notes mature Jan 31, 1999, and the five-year notes mature Jan 31, 2002.</p>
<p>The CUSIP number for the 2-year notes will be 9128272F8 and for the five-year notes will be 9128272G6.</p>
